  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">从HUD中移除空的护甲槽，使界面更加简洁：</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1439054/description_f56093b4-0001-42f6-823c-286f8f68bb77.png\" width=\"501\" height=\"157\"><br>与原版Minecraft对比：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1439054/description_82e117d3-6931-4ff9-ac19-c1ef0ebe7dcb.png\" width=\"501\" height=\"157\"></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">灵感源自原版MC的“吸收之心”：</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1439054/description_c44043d0-089a-470f-8457-5cae0cfe6f7d.png\" width=\"501\" height=\"157\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">v1.20.2（<em>最新版本</em>）及以上版本与其他所有资源包兼容。<br>只需在资源包加载列表中将其置于其他资源包之上即可生效。</p>",
